1.11. The Monaco crèches  welcome four in ten resident children aged 2 and under
The Principality of Monaco has 15 early-years childcare facilities on its territory, including 13 public ones: 8
collective crèche, 1 family crèche, 3 microcrèche, and 1 early-learning garden. They can also admit young
children who are neither Monegasque nor residents, under certain conditions, just as schools do. Here, the
children considered are residents in 2025 who attend a public or private crèche located in Monaco.
Table 9. Number of resident children aged 0 to 2 attending crèche in Monaco by sector in 2024 and 2025
Sources: Monaco City Hall, Princess Grace Hospital Center, Monegasque Red Cross, Monaco Statistics – Population Censuses
