2025
Sources: Monaco City Hall, Princess Grace Hospital Center, Monegasque Red Cross, Monaco Statistics – Population Censuses
In 2025, 39.4% of children aged 2 and under living in Monaco are enrolled in crèches, a very slight decrease
from 2024 (40.1%). At the same time, the number of resident children enrolled falls from 385 to 369.
The share of children attending private nurseries is almost stable, up by 0.2 points, while the share attending
public nurseries falls by 0.9 points.
